    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SAN FRANCISCO FROM THE PACIFIC, GOLDEN GATE, G. G. BRIDGE, BUSINESS DISTRICT,\n41\n8A-H315G\nSAN FRANCISCO.OAKLAND BAY BRIDGE, WORLD'S FAIR, OAKLAND, BERKELEY, ALAMEDA AND E. BAY CITIES IN DISTANCE",
